---
const formats = ['Books', 'PDFs', 'Articles', 'Audio', 'Video', 'Notes'];
---

<section id="capture" class="home-section wrap" aria-labelledby="capture-heading">
  <h2 id="capture-heading">One library. Whatever you read next.</h2>
  <p data-claim-pending="true">
    The walkthrough follows one essay on sleep and memory. Capture is where that essay lands
    beside the rest of a working library, not in another single-purpose inbox.
  </p>
  <ul class="format-strip">
    {formats.map((name) => <li>{name}</li>)}
  </ul>
</section>
